OL,3,GNEWSARefugee passes GCSE after fleeing
OL,4,Awar-torn Sudan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA refugee who fled a war-torn country
OL,7,Fand found safety in the UK before
OL,8,Fbecoming a football referee says he has
OL,9,Fproved "you can achieve your goals"
OL,10,Fafter passing his GCSEs.
OL,12,FNasser Hamid grew-up in a "tiny"
OL,13,Fvillage in Sudan, where millions have
OL,14,Fbeen displaced since the country's
OL,15,Fcivil war began in 2023.
OL,17,FThe 20-year-old, who was 16 at the time
OL,18,Fand could not speak English, fled his
OL,19,Fhome and moved to Ipswich, where he was
OL,20,Fhelped by Suffolk Refugee Support.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
