OL,3,GNEWSARefugee passes GCSE after fleeing
OL,4,Awar-torn Sudan
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter passing GCSE English earlier this
OL,7,Fyear, he has now achieved grade 4 in
OL,8,Fmaths and said it was "one of the
OL,9,Fproudest moments in my life".
